<title>USA: Chevron names Boeing chairman to board.</title>
<headline>Chevron names Boeing chairman to board.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chevron Corp said it has named Boeing Co Chairman Frank Shrontz to Chevron's board of directors, boosting the size of Chevron's board to 11.</p>
<p>Shrontz, 64, was chief executive officer of Boeing from April 1986 until April of this year.</p>
</text>
